& [FSC1FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable final-slice surface for FSC1 foundation contracts
  + [chunk_ref] is FSC1 foundation contracts
  + [chunk_boundary] is P2 authority kernel schemas, P3 compiled SOP operator contracts, and P8a foundation fixtures
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is FSC0 authority baseline
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC1-S01
  + [gated_slice_set] is FSC1-S02, FSC1-S03, FSC1-S04, FSC1-S05, FSC1-S06, and FSC1-S07

  = must: execute FSC1-S01 before any other FSC1 slice
  = must: run completed-work review after each slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts the current slice assumptions
  = must: keep FSC2 through FSC5 gated until FSC1-S07 accepts the foundation contract pack

